---
import { TESTIMONIALS } from '../../../data/studio';
---
<section class="section section-testimonials"><div class="wrap testimonial-feature"><div class="testimonial-label"><span class="section-index">05</span><span class="eyebrow">IN THEIR WORDS / CLIENT NOTES</span><span class="eyebrow">01 — 04</span></div><div class="testimonial-main"><span class="quote-mark">“</span><blockquote>{TESTIMONIALS[0].quote}</blockquote><div class="testimonial-byline"><div><b>{TESTIMONIALS[0].name}</b><span>CLIENT TESTIMONIAL · PUBLIC SITE</span></div><span class="stars">★★★★★ <small>{TESTIMONIALS[0].rating}</small></span></div></div><aside class="testimonial-side"><p>Good work is a collaboration. We’re grateful for the people who trust us with their ideas.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Make something together ↗</a><div class="testimonial-mini">{TESTIMONIALS.slice(1).map((item) => <div><span>“{item.quote.slice(0, 88)}…”</span><b>— {item.name}</b></div>)}</div></aside></div></section>
